{"task_id": "Mbpp/102", "solution": "def snake_to_camel(snake_case: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a snake_case string to a PascalCase string, performing validation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not snake_case:\n        return \"\"\n\n    if any(c.isupper() for c in snake_case):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must not contain uppercase letters.\")\n    if any(c.isspace() for c in snake_case):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must not contain spaces.\")\n    if '__' in snake_case:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must not contain consecutive underscores.\")\n    if snake_case.startswith('_'):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must not start with an underscore.\")\n    if snake_case.endswith('_'):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must not end with an underscore.\")\n\n    parts = snake_case.split('_')\n    camel_parts = [part.capitalize() for part in parts]\n    return ''.join(camel_parts)"}
