{"task_id": "Mbpp/165", "solution": "def count_char_position(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of characters in `input_string` that are at the same\n    position as their corresponding letter in the English alphabet.\n    Comparison is case\u2011insensitive.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    for idx, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        # Alphabet positions are 1\u2011based: 'a' -> 1, 'b' -> 2, ...\n        alphabet_pos = idx + 1\n        # Convert to lowercase for case\u2011insensitive comparison\n        if alphabet_pos <= 26 and char.lower() == chr(ord('a') + alphabet_pos - 1):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
