{"task_id": "Mbpp/581", "solution": "def surface_Area(base_edge, height):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the surface area of a square pyramid using a simplified formula.\n    The formula used is base_edge^2 + 2 * base_edge * height.\"\"\"\n    base_area = base_edge ** 2\n    lateral_area_simplified = 2 * base_edge * height\n    total_surface_area = base_area + lateral_area_simplified\n    return float(total_surface_area)"}
