{"task_id": "Mbpp/762", "solution": "def check_monthnumber_number(month: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given month number (1-12) contains 30 days.\n    Raises ValueError for invalid month numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(month, int) or not (1 <= month <= 12):\n        raise ValueError(\"Month number must be an integer between 1 and 12.\")\n\n    months_with_30_days = {4, 6, 9, 11}\n    return month in months_with_30_days"}
